---
title: View a Debt Projection
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor FU as Tom: Finance User
    participant C as caller:Controller
    participant D as selectedDebt:Debt
    participant DPR as DebtPayoffResult

    FU ->>+ C: Request payoff projection
    C ->>+ D: projectPayoffTimeline
    D ->> D: startingInterest receives returned value
    D ->>+ DPR: impossible()

    alt monthly payment <= starting interest
        create participant FR as failedResult: DebtPayoffResult
        D <<-->> FR: failedResult:DebtPayoffResult
        FR -->> DPR: failed result

    end
